silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_04_federation_contract_and_messages_sections_01_federation_contract_concrete_anchor_node1 silm:hasLongDescription "The FederationContractSourceNode is Typed message with aboutness arrow (source input). In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Source (typed federation object)', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
